---
---
<section id="industries" class="section-padding bg-gray-50">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Industries We Serve</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Data-sensitive industries where privacy-first AI makes the difference. Each sector has unique compliance and confidentiality requirements that on-premise AI solves natively.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
      <!-- Law Firms -->
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">⚖️</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Law Firms</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Müvekkil dosyaları, sözleşmeler ve dava belgeleri ofis dışına çıkmaz; AI destekli belge arama ve özet çıkarma, avukat-müvekkil gizliliğini ihlal etmeden yapılır.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Healthcare -->
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">🏥</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Healthcare</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Hasta verileri (KVKK/GDPR en hassas kategori) buluta gitmez; randevu, rapor özetleme, triyaj desteği yerel sunucuda kalır.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Accounting -->
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">📊</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Accounting</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Mali tablolar, vergi kayıtları ve müşteri finansal verileri şirket dışına çıkmadan otomatik rapor ve analiz.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Manufacturing -->
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">🏭</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Manufacturing</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Üretim verileri, tedarikçi sözleşmeleri ve know-how sızıntı riski olmadan AI ile analiz edilir; internet kesintisinde bile çalışır.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Engineering -->
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">⚙️</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Engineering</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Teknik çizimler, patentli tasarımlar ve kaynak kodu yerel kalır; kod üretimi/RAG dokümantasyon dışarıya veri sızdırmaz.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Real Estate -->
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">🏠</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Real Estate</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Müşteri finansal bilgileri ve sözleşme verileri güvenli kalır; ilan/sözleşme otomasyonu bulut bağımlılığı olmadan yürür.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Education -->
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">🎓</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Education</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Öğrenci kişisel verileri (öz. reşit olmayanlar) hiçbir üçüncü tarafa gitmez; yerel bilgi bankası (RAG) oluşturulur.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Marketing Agencies -->
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">📱</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Marketing Agencies</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Müşteri kampanya verileri ve stratejileri rakiplerin erişemeyeceği şekilde izole alanda işlenir.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Finance -->
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">🏦</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Finance</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Regülasyon gereği veri işleme kısıtlamaları (bankacılık mevzuatı) bulut AI ile çakışır; on-premise baştan çözer.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Government -->
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">🏛️</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Government</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Vatandaş verisi ve ulusal güvenlik belge ABD merkezli buluta gitmez; veri egemenliği (data sovereignty) sağlanır.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Any Industry CTA -->
    <div class="text-center mt-16 p-8 md:p-12 bg-indigo-50 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-100">
      <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Any Industry. Any Workflow. Complete Privacy.</h3>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-6">
        We build custom AI infrastructure tailored to your organization's workflows, security requirements and compliance needs.
        Whether you're a logistics company, architecture firm, insurance agency, or any other data-sensitive business —
        the same privacy-first architecture adapts to your processes.
      </p>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2">
        Discuss Your Use Case
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" />
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>